.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# Phase 18 · UI/UX skill (cloned reference, not project code — install via
# `npx ui-ux-pro-max-cli init --ai claude` when needed for project-wide scope)
.claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max-skill/

# ui-ux-pro-max installs its skill bundle into .claude/skills/ — design tooling,
